OL,3,GNEWSATwo seriously injured in M&S car
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car has crashed into a Marks &
OL,7,FSpencer (M&S) shop in a retail park,
OL,8,Fseriously injuring two pedestrians.
OL,10,FThe collision in the Silverlink Retail
OL,11,FPark in North Tyneside happened at
OL,12,Fabout 14:15 BST.
OL,14,FThe pedestrians, a man and a woman in
OL,15,Ftheir 60s, were taken to hospital for
OL,16,Ftreatment, Northumbria Police said.
OL,18,FThe driver of the car, a woman in her
OL,19,F70s, remained at the scene to assist
OL,20,Fpolice.
